From: RenkuOS GPU Development <gpu-development@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:15:25 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] intel_extreme: add Type-C HDMI transcoder plan

---
 .../intel_extreme/TypeCHdmiTranscoder.h       | 50 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 50 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/TypeCHdmiTranscoder.h

diff --git a/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/TypeCHdmiTranscoder.h b/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/TypeCHdmiTranscoder.h
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..fba63d23
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/add-ons/accelerants/intel_extreme/TypeCHdmiTranscoder.h
@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
+/*
